{"pass": 1, "id": "GOLD-040", "answerable": true, "gold_doc_paths": ["scheduling-eviction/pod-priority-preemption.md"], "key_fact_regexes": ["PriorityClass", "preempt"], "answer": "A PriorityClass defines a Pod's priority by mapping a priority class name to an integer priority value, which is then used to set the `.spec.priority` field of the Pod [source_id:0]. When a Pod specifies a `priorityClassName`, the priority admission controller uses this to populate the Pod's priority value [source_id:0].", "top_sources": ["workloads/workload-api/disruption-and-priority.md", "scheduling-eviction/pod-priority-preemption.md", "workloads/pods/advanced-pod-config.md", "policy/resource-quotas.md", "workloads/pods/_index.md"], "citations": [], "answered_by": "qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M", "seconds": 39.2, "attached": [["workloads/workload-api/disruption-and-priority.md", "workloads/workload-api/disruption-and-priority.md", "scheduling-eviction/pod-priority-preemption.md", "workloads/pods/advanced-pod-config.md", "scheduling-eviction/pod-priority-preemption.md"]]}
{"pass": 1, "id": "GOLD-043", "answerable": true, "gold_doc_paths": ["resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md"], "key_fact_regexes": ["Topology|NUMA|exclusive", "CPU|Memory"], "answer": "Pod-level resource managers allow for defining hybrid allocation models within a Pod, where some containers receive exclusive, NUMA-aligned resources and others share from a pod-level shared pool [0]. They enable the use of pod-level resource specifications, such as CPU and memory requests and limits, which helps in setting an overall resource budget for the Pod [0]. This facilitates improved resource utilization by allowing containers to share idle resources within the Pod [0].", "top_sources": ["resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "resource-management/resource-managers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md", "workloads/pods/pod-qos.md", "workloads/pods/_index.md"], "citations": ["resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "resource-management/resource-managers.md", "resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md", "resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "resource-management/resource-managers.md", "resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md", "resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "resource-management/resource-managers.md", "resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md"], "answered_by": "qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M", "seconds": 40.1, "attached": [["resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "resource-management/resource-managers.md", "resource-management/pod-level-resource-managers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md", "configuration/manage-resources-containers.md"]]}
