{"pass": 1, "id": "GOLD-117", "answerable": true, "gold_doc_paths": ["overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md"], "key_fact_regexes": ["ownerReferences"], "answer": "The field on a dependent object that points to its owner is `metadata.ownerReferences` [0]. This field contains the object name and a UID within the same namespace as the dependent object [0].", "top_sources": ["overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "workloads/controllers/replicaset.md", "workloads/controllers/statefulset.md", "resource-management/dynamic-resource-allocation/dra-api.md"], "citations": ["overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md"], "answered_by": "qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M", "seconds": 32.5, "attached": [["overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md"]]}
{"pass": 1, "id": "GOLD-118", "answerable": true, "gold_doc_paths": ["architecture/garbage-collection.md"], "key_fact_regexes": ["foreground", "background", "dependents"], "answer": "In foreground cascading deletion, the owner object enters a \"deletion in progress\" state where it sets `metadata.deletionTimestamp` and `metadata.finalizers` to `foregroundDeletion`, remains visible in the API, and has its dependents deleted before the owner is removed [0]. In background cascading deletion, the Kubernetes API server deletes the owner object immediately, and the garbage collector cleans up dependent objects in the background, with finalizers ensuring clean-up tasks are completed before deletion [0]. By default, Kubernetes uses background cascading deletion unless foreground deletion is manually specified or dependents are orphaned [0].", "top_sources": ["architecture/garbage-collection.md", "storage/volume-snapshot-classes.md", "overview/working-with-objects/owners-dependents.md", "storage/volume-snapshots.md", "overview/working-with-objects/finalizers.md"], "citations": ["architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "storage/volume-snapshot-classes.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "storage/volume-snapshot-classes.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "storage/volume-snapshot-classes.md"], "answered_by": "qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M", "seconds": 43.7, "attached": [["architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "architecture/garbage-collection.md", "storage/volume-snapshot-classes.md"]]}
{"pass": 1, "id": "GOLD-136", "answerable": true, "gold_doc_paths": ["services-networking/gateway.md"], "key_fact_regexes": ["GatewayClass", "Gateway", "HTTPRoute"], "answer": "The Gateway API describes four stable API kinds: GatewayClass, Gateway, HTTPRoute, and GRPCRoute [0]. GatewayClass defines a set of gateways with common configuration, Gateway defines an instance of traffic handling infrastructure, HTTPRoute defines HTTP-specific traffic routing rules, and GRPCRoute defines gRPC-specific traffic routing rules [0].", "top_sources": ["services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/ingress-controllers.md", "services-networking/_index.md", "cluster-administration/addons.md"], "citations": ["services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md"], "answered_by": "qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M", "seconds": 34.3, "attached": [["services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md", "services-networking/gateway.md"]]}
